{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "PXRDCC5Z7K3WML24BY3G4LPDKQWCWHXX",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041133001",
    "title": "第1章 近代レースの現在地",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 1: The Current State of Modern Racing",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "？？？",
            "enName": "？？？",
            "jpText": "『――トゥインクル・シリーズの歴史。\nそれは、先人たちが残した栄光の蹄跡』",
            "enText": "『——The history of the Twinkle Series. It is the glorious trail left behind by our predecessors』",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 267,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 306,
                    "pathId": 7114113444822365334
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 329,
                    "pathId": -3758159703173108842
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 325,
                    "pathId": -9138903084337467718
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1678590791612193622,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "？？？",
            "enName": "？？？",
            "jpText": "『偉業、威光、伝説……全て築かれた。歴史書を紐解けば、\nそこにはあまりにも美しい“軌跡”がずらりと並んでいる』",
            "enText": "『Great achievements, prestige, legends……all have been forged. If you unravel the history books, an array of breathtakingly beautiful <i>trails</i> are lined up』",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 443,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 485,
                    "pathId": 8990064091730447365
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 485,
                    "pathId": -2181715463804391785
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 485,
                    "pathId": -3556344548721180742
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -2605973436067382228
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7160210772991545189
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 239,
                    "pathId": -2095212656312875846
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4010714086362395225
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 528,
                    "pathId": 2760082354794127527
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 230,
                    "pathId": 9125246941127922489
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9193412886106109835,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "？？？",
            "enName": "？？？",
            "jpText": "『ページを繰る度に胸躍る、実話の数々。\nその先で、いつか――』",
            "enText": "『A myriad of true stories that make your heart race with every turn of the page. And beyond them, someday——』",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 265,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 307,
                    "pathId": -8322718650725903435
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 68,
                    "pathId": 5424611894439630477
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 307,
                    "pathId": 730002147679753407
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 307,
                    "pathId": -8059728648989890510
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -8820136557343848502
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 307,
                    "pathId": 5578069056663583214
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -605374668081402423,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ある日の仕事中、スマホのアラームが鳴りだした。\nカレンダーにセットしていたこれが鳴ったということは――",
            "enText": "One day at work, my smartphone alarm suddenly went off. If this calendar alarm is ringing, that means——",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ！校内新聞の配布、今日か！",
                    "enText": "Ah! Today's the newspaper distribution!",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "あっ！校内新聞の配布、今日だ！",
                    "enText": "Ah! Today's the newspaper distribution!",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 1247243332161289408
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -2720590126359744696
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3301112795724296935,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "校内新聞とは、月に一度、広報委員が制作している新聞で……\n学園内のニュースなどを取り扱っているものだ。",
            "enText": "The school newspaper is published once a month by the PR Committee……covering various news and events within the academy",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 9065867837812081857,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――中でも、毎月掲載されているコラムは読み応え抜群。\n自分はそれを楽しみに校内新聞をもらっていた。",
            "enText": "——Among its contents, the monthly column is especially worth reading. I always looked forward to picking up the paper just for that.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "すみません、一部ください！",
                    "enText": "Excuse me, I'd like a copy please!",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 200,
                    "pathId": -4190281322351256611
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -4757981525086112378
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6183614547931375128,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "あ、はい……どうぞ。",
            "enText": "Ah, yes……Here you go.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いつもありがとう！",
                    "enText": "Thanks, as always!",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 70,
                    "pathId": -1589134211860812354
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4043250337421436536
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7920338353516969759,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "い、いえ……こちらこそ。\nいつももらっていただき、ありがとうございます。",
            "enText": "N-No……You're welcome. \nThank you for always picking one up.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 151,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 202,
                    "pathId": 2276062043869507378
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 51,
                    "pathId": 236969740776066295
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2592289585481770227,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "受け取った新聞を早速広げる。『徒然、歴史語り』と\n銘打たれたそれが、目的のコラムだった――",
            "enText": "I quickly unfold the newspaper I received. \nTitled \"Musings on History\" it was the very column I was looking for——",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 29,
                    "pathId": -3210125991386410467
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 29,
                    "pathId": 3231111605313146889
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1919742892721241734,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライターC",
            "enName": "Writer C",
            "jpText": "『幼少期に負ったケガのため、デビューが遅れ……デビュー後も\n順調とはいかず、日本ダービーの結果は冴えないものだった』",
            "enText": "『Due to an injury suffered in her childhood, her debut was delayed……Even after her debut, things didn't go smoothly, and her results in the Japanese Derby were lackluster』",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 327,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 254237526170141412,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライターC",
            "enName": "Writer C",
            "jpText": "『しかし、彼女は走り続けた。2勝クラス、3勝クラスを物にし――\n目黒記念以降は大躍進。琥珀の輝きを見せつけ、有馬を制した』",
            "enText": "『However, she kept running. She took the 2-Win and 3-Win classes—— then surged after the Meguro Kinen. Radiating an amber brilliance, she won the Arima Kinen』",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 432,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 8000022382452564403,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライターC",
            "enName": "Writer C",
            "jpText": "『――そんな彼女の薫陶を受けたウマ娘が、現代にいるのだ。\n休養した春を超え、秋に花開いた遅咲きの娘が――』",
            "enText": "『——A horsegirl who received her discipline and teachings exists in the present day. A late bloomer who pushed past a rested spring to blossom in the autumn——』",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 371,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -8860987974802634813,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライターC",
            "enName": "Writer C",
            "jpText": "『インタビューの際、彼女は呟いた。“やっと、同期と並べる\n私になれそうなんです。だから――掴みますよ、このまま”』",
            "enText": "『During the interview, she murmured \"I feel like I can finally stand shoulder-to-shoulder with my peers. That's why — I'm going to seize it, just like this\"』",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 406,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 66988622784299091,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライターC",
            "enName": "Writer C",
            "jpText": "『歴史が証明している。彼女はやがて、重賞を戴く傑物となる。\n物語は、新年最初の東京レース場から動き出す（ライターC）』",
            "enText": "『History bears witness. Before long, she will become a great figure decorated with graded stakes victories. The story begins at the very first Tokyo race of the New Year. (Writer C)』",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 434,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（いやー。本当に興味深いな、このコラム）",
                    "enText": "(This column's really fascinating)",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（うん。本当に興味深いなぁ、このコラム）",
                    "enText": "(This column's really interesting)",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6377309236714088635,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "歴史を紹介するだけではない。それに紐づけて、現役のウマ娘も\n紹介し――現在へと繋げてくれる。それがこのコラムの魅力だった。",
            "enText": "It doesn't just introduce history. By tying it to the past, it introduces currently active horsegirl — connecting it to the present. That's the charm of this column.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "執筆者……ライターCって誰なんだろう？",
                    "enText": "The author… I wonder who <i>Writer C</i> is?",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -976651051508987136,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "呟きつつ、カレンダーを確認する。――コラムに掲載されていた\nウマ娘が出走するのは、年が明けてすぐの金曜日らしい。",
            "enText": "As I mutter, I check the calendar. —It looks like the horsegirl featured in the column is racing on the Friday right after the New Year.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 118,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ちょうど暇だし、行ってみようかな！",
                    "enText": "I've got some time to kill, so I think I'll go!",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8709262037394602876,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "迎えたその日。まだレースまで時間があったので、\nウマ娘ミュージアムを訪れると……。",
            "enText": "The day finally arrived. Since there was still some time before the race, I decided to visit the Horsegirl Museum, and…….",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、いつも新聞をくれる……",
                    "enText": "Ah, the newspaper girl…",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 187,
                    "pathId": 5273905765471768271
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": -8431488755267988950
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7033766740788024241,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "…………彼女たちの意思は、いまだ現代に繋がっている。\nそのことが、何度見ても……何度でも……。",
            "enText": "………Their will is still connected to the present day. No matter how many times I see it……over and over…….",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 458,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 254,
                    "pathId": 1808090758941788926
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 87,
                    "pathId": -8759357269524341025
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8080035228919425334,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "……ふふ。\nもう一周だけ、しようかな……。",
            "enText": "……Fufu. \nMaybe I'll go around one more time…….",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 165,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 117,
                    "pathId": 6071048730120212853
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6357652997095434962
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6144057975818200035,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ウマ娘ミュージアムを巡ったのち。\nパドックを訪れると、そこにも彼女がいた。",
            "enText": "After touring the Horsegirl Museum, I visited the paddock, and she was there as well.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 93,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 121,
                    "pathId": 7792175223274172326
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": 7436829354888086355
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3860246684926354225,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "…………\n…………。",
            "enText": "………… \n…………。",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 65,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（す、すごい真剣にウマ娘を撮ってる……）",
                    "enText": "(S-She's taking photos so intently…)",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -4395968630048723004
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 134,
                    "pathId": -6607129528260278884
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5588400639129119457,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "……んー。レンズ、絞りすぎたかも。\nもうちょっと開きめで……何枚か。",
            "enText": "……Hmmー I might have stopped down the lens too much. Let's open it up a bit more……and take a few more shots.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 262,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 275,
                    "pathId": 6767225902496298634
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 310,
                    "pathId": -3090519445211785416
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4609894999399546199,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "今度はスタンドで彼女を発見する。手には\n今朝購入したと思しきスポーツ新聞を携えていた。",
            "enText": "This time I spot her in the stands. In her hand, she's carrying a sports newspaper she likely bought this morning.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 200,
                    "pathId": 7626823316675438347
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": -6045727509692439923
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5543184722011746689,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "……2000になると、このコースは瞬発力も求められる……でも、\n前走が同じコースで、あの上がりタイムなら――問題ない。",
            "enText": "……At 2000 meters, this course demands explosive speed too……But, her previous race was on the same track, and with that closing time — it should be no problem.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 356,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 381,
                    "pathId": -5452782052110553641
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 2482797522870700317
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5949705285286726181,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "追い切りや記者さんからの評判も上々……1番人気は、2番。\n――結果と評価が、ようやく彼女に結びついた。",
            "enText": "Her final training and the word from the reporters are are excellent… The top favorite is #2. —Performance and reputation have finally caught up with her.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 338,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 381,
                    "pathId": 736589233502741751
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8087004733302765287,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "パドックを見た感じ、3番もよかったけど……\n今日のバ場ならキレ負けない。それに、歴史の観点から見ても――",
            "enText": "Judging by the paddock, #3 looked good too, but…… on today's track, she won't be out-sprinted. Besides, from a historical standpoint as well—",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 356,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 381,
                    "pathId": 2188068775640294347
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3608550616464070257
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3408783104241334561,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "今日、彼女が勝ったらアツい。",
            "enText": "Today, if she wins, it'll be incredibly hype.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 118,
                    "pathId": -3853690735243790282
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": 7783653612589414122
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4495188290660320702,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Announcer",
            "jpText": "完全に抜け出した！　2番！　2番です！\n凄まじい末脚で、勝利をもぎ取りましたっ！！",
            "enText": "She's broken clear! It's #2! #2! With an incredible burst of speed, she's snatched the victory!!",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 214,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "すごい！コラムで特集されてたあの娘が……",
                    "enText": "Amazing! That girl from the column…",
                    "nextBlock": 29
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -984731315017828830
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -8509222062102895652
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5029852075959690422,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "……うっ……ううっ……\nく、う……！",
            "enText": "……Hh……uuh…… \nh-hgh……!",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": 2391571307970311854
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 104,
                    "pathId": 4282161423157151814
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6911770519148040972,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "うううううううっ……！！",
            "enText": "Waaaaaaaaah……!!",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 52,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（な、なんかすごい泣いてる……！？）",
                    "enText": "(S-She's really crying her eyes out…!?)",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 63,
