        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "そこに、ちゃんと立ち会っていたいんです。情報をただ追うだけ\nではなく――現地で。その時その場で、生の感動を受け取りたい。",
            "enText": "I want to be present and bear witness to it all. It's not enough to just track the data — I have to be at the track. I want to feel the live impact of the moment as it happens.",
